      "content": "hey i need help with something weird. i've been seeing posts from my own accounts and messages from my friends that i definitely didnt send... like the tone is almost right but just slightly off? is it possible for an ai to have scraped enough of my data to mimic my writing style perfectly? i feel like i'm being replaced online",
