      "content": "it's so scary that you're confirming this. my brother thinks i'm just being paranoid but he's actually been talking to the 'other me' on messenger all morning without even knowing it... how can i actually prove to him that it's not me? like, is there a way to catch the replica in a lie or find out what data it used to build itself?",
